Wake the FIFO consumer when completed mapped SPU DMA changes its registered
producer-park command. Publish address and expected word atomically, retain
the arm/reread handshake and bounded timeout, and ignore unchanged copies.

diff --git a/libs/video/cellGcmSys.c b/libs/video/cellGcmSys.c
--- a/libs/video/cellGcmSys.c
+++ b/libs/video/cellGcmSys.c
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@
